{"title": "Vampiric Touch (Condition)", "pageid": 10434, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Vampiric_Touch_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack priority", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vampiric Touch Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Vampiric Touch</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Each turn, using an <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Action</a>, can recast <a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch\" title=\"Vampiric Touch\">Vampiric Touch</a> without expending a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_Slots\" title=\"Spells\">Spell Slot</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">VAMPIRIC_TOUCH</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CVAMPIRIC_TOUCH%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CVAMPIRIC_TOUCH%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 4</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch\" title=\"Vampiric Touch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/40px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/60px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/80px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vampiric Touch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/40px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch\" title=\"Vampiric Touch\">Vampiric Touch</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> + <span aria-label=\"Level 3 Spell Slot\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Level 3 Spell Slot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Touch an enemy to siphon their life force and regain half as many <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a>. </dd>\n</dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Vampiric_Touch\">Sources of Vampiric Touch</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Vampiric_Touch\" title=\"Scroll of Vampiric Touch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Scroll_of_Vampiric_Touch_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Vampiric_Touch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Scroll_of_Vampiric_Touch_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Scroll_of_Vampiric_Touch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Scroll_of_Vampiric_Touch_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Scroll_of_Vampiric_Touch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Scroll_of_Vampiric_Touch_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Vampiric_Touch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Scroll_of_Vampiric_Touch_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Vampiric_Touch\" title=\"Scroll of Vampiric Touch\">Scroll of Vampiric Touch</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch\" title=\"Vampiric Touch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/30px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/45px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/60px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vampiric Touch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/30px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch\" title=\"Vampiric Touch\">Vampiric Touch</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>VAMPIRIC_TOUCH</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Absorbed_Essence:_Amelyssan\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbed_Essence:_Amelyssan_(Condition)\" title=\"Absorbed Essence: Amelyssan (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Bhaalspawn_Essence_Amelyssan_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bhaalspawn_Essence_Amelyssan_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Bhaalspawn_Essence_Amelyssan_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bhaalspawn_Essence_Amelyssan_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Bhaalspawn_Essence_Amelyssan_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bhaalspawn_Essence_Amelyssan_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Absorbed Essence: Amelyssan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Bhaalspawn_Essence_Amelyssan_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bhaalspawn_Essence_Amelyssan_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Bhaalspawn_Essence_Amelyssan_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbed_Essence:_Amelyssan_(Condition)\" title=\"Absorbed Essence: Amelyssan (Condition)\">Absorbed Essence: Amelyssan</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Sarevok's attacks now heal him by <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">2d12</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> each time.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Vampiric_Touch\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch_(Condition)\" title=\"Vampiric Touch (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vampiric Touch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Vampiric Touch</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Each turn, using an <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Action</a>, can recast <a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch\" title=\"Vampiric Touch\">Vampiric Touch</a> without expending a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_Slots\" title=\"Spells\">Spell Slot</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715062123\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2458/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38815/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8816/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.040/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1256415/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.601      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   63.601      1 -total\n 49.96%   31.777      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 32.84%   20.887      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 20.72%   13.177      2 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 14.02%    8.917      6 Template:Icon_text\n 13.98%    8.893     27 Template:Trim\n 13.92%    8.852      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 12.63%    8.032      5 Template:Icon_link\n 10.98%    6.982      1 Template:Item_icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:10434-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715062123 and revision id 377427. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}